{"meta":{"id":"loop","category":"it/syntax/jsp/jstl","title":"반복문 (c:forEach) · JSP","subtitle":"(JSP · JSTL · EL)","summary":"begin · end · step, items 반복과 varStatus(index · count · first · last), forTokens","tags":["jsp","f-control","f-array"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-violet","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>JSP · JSTL · EL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">반복문 (c:forEach) · JSP</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> begin · end · step, items 반복과 varStatus(index · count · first · last), forTokens</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">횟수 반복</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;c:forEach var=&quot;i&quot; begin=&quot;1&quot; end=&quot;10&quot; step=&quot;1&quot;&gt;   &lt;!-- 1 이상 10 이하, step 1 은 생략 가능 --&gt;\r\n  ${i} /\r\n&lt;/c:forEach&gt;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">배열 · 리스트 반복 (varStatus)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;c:forEach var=&quot;vo&quot; items=&quot;${vos}&quot; varStatus=&quot;st&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;c:if test=&quot;${st.first}&quot;&gt; 처음 &lt;/c:if&gt;\r\n  ${st.index} (${st.count}). ${vo.name}\r\n  &lt;c:if test=&quot;${st.last}&quot;&gt; 끝 &lt;/c:if&gt;\r\n&lt;/c:forEach&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;c:forTokens var=&quot;card&quot; items=&quot;${cards}&quot; delims=&quot;/&quot;&gt;   &lt;!-- 구분자로 나눠서 반복 --&gt;\r\n  &lt;c:if test=&quot;${card == &#x27;BC&#x27; || card == &#x27;삼성&#x27;}&quot;&gt; ${card} &lt;/c:if&gt;\r\n&lt;/c:forTokens&gt;</pre></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">varStatus</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의미</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>st.index</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">0 부터 시작하는 순서</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>st.count</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1 부터 시작하는 번호</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>st.first / st.last</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">처음 / 마지막이면 true</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-violet-700 font-semibold\">원본 메모는 index(1부터) · count(0부터)로 반대로 적혀 있었다 — index 가 0부터, count 가 1부터.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 배열, JavaScript › forEach</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jsp/jstl/loop","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jsp","title":"JSP · JSTL · EL","path":"it/syntax/jsp"},{"id":"jstl","title":"JSTL","path":"it/syntax/jsp/jstl"}],"hasImage":false}